#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Provider-neutral calendar helper for the Omarchy calendar plugin.

The first implementation exposes a stable JSON protocol and a mock provider.
The Evolution Data Server adapter is intentionally isolated behind the same
interface so the QML plugin does not know which account provider is backing a
calendar source.
"""

